# Deny by default. Images are built from package metadata and runtime code only.
*

!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!pro_pilot/
!pro_pilot/**/*.py
!pro_pilot/**/*.j2

# Never send local state, credentials, test data, or repository metadata to the
# Docker daemon, even if a broader allowlist is added above later.
.env*
.aws/
.kube/
**/kubeconfig
**/credentials
**/*secret*
.git/
.github/
.venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
tests/
eval/
out/
config/
docs/
spec/
deploy/
